0,"Dj Give Thanks - MBATA TAA (Official Audio) | Gambian Music ...Stream mbat music | Listen to songs, albums, playlists for ...MBAT - Album by EXILE ATSUSHI - YouTube MusicPeople die music never die Mbat 009 | M BatMbat AI — Translation, Text-to-Speech & Speech Recognition ...Niger-Congo - playlist by Music League | SpotifyMusic | M Bat",https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GxI6k5wDKXo,"Jun 1, 2026 · MBATA TAA — I am tired and I am calling it all out 😤💔🙏🇬🇲 I am tired of fake smiles and fake love — real ones stand up 💯 🇬🇲 Support Gambian Music! Play mbat and discover followers on SoundCloud | Stream tracks, albums, playlists on desktop and mobile. Listen to MBAT by EXILE ATSUSHI on YouTube Music - a dedicated music app with official songs, music videos, remixes, covers, and more. Nov 6, 2023 · This case is the return of Kitebo Man, an old glory of urban music in Tanzania, an artist born in Bagamoyo, he traveled through many countries and returned to Tanzania and stayed in Zanzibar for a long time. Mbat, also known as Mbat, is a Niger-Congo language spoken by approximately 5K people across Nigeria. It uses the Latin writing system and is identified by the ISO 639-3 code bau. Playlist · Niger-Congo · 22 items · 4 saves Cookies, device or similar online identifiers together with other information (e.g. browser type and information, language, screen size, supported technologies, etc.) can be stored or read on your device to recognise it each time it connects to an app or to a website, for one or several of the purposes presented here. Born from a humanitarian project called Mortal Combat, material produced and recorded with a portable studio in 2 years of voluntary work that generated more than 300 songs, you can listen to and contribute to many other projects to help artists, schools and children in Tanzania. Thanks for your support and for your donations.",Mbat,Niger-Congo
